# Ignore auto-generated XDG content by default
*

# Tracked home-dir dotfiles
!.gitignore
!.gitconfig
!.hushlogin
!.ripgreprc
!gitignore_global
!vscode/
!vscode/**

# Tracked XDG configs (added as each config is processed)
!starship.toml
!glow/
!glow/**
!btop/
!btop/**
!pnpm/
!pnpm/**
!tmux/
!tmux/**
!gh/
!gh/config.yml
!k9s/
!k9s/**
!nvim/
!nvim/**
!fastfetch/
!fastfetch/**
!atuin/
!atuin/**
!mise/
!mise/**
!awsume/
!awsume/**
!ghostty/
!ghostty/**
!hypr/
!hypr/**
!bat/
!bat/**
!lazygit/
!lazygit/**

# yazi: only our own config and the package lockfile. flavors/ and plugins/ are
# vendored by `ya pkg` and stay untracked -- `ya pkg install` restores them.
!yazi/
!yazi/yazi.toml
!yazi/theme.toml
!yazi/init.lua
!yazi/package.toml

# Generated by Noctalia's `hyprland` colour template from the active palette.
# Machine state, not config: hypr/hyprland.lua reads its colours table (see the
# comment there) and it is rewritten on every palette change. Has to sit AFTER
# the !hypr/** negation above -- the last matching pattern wins.
hypr/noctalia.lua
